Subject: [PATCH] Add deterministic language coverage manifest diffs (#3101)

Compare versioned clinical language-pack coverage manifests by canonical
locale, script, identifier classes, surrogate support and evidence digest,
and render byte-stable added, removed, improved, regressed and changed
entries as JSON and Markdown. Manifests reject unknown keys so fixture
text, model paths and evaluation examples cannot reach the diff.

Record the measured Pages artifact size of the new guide in the brand
byte budgets, keeping the existing aggregate and search allowances.
